TI  - The First Standardized Scoring System to Assess the Welfare of Free-Ranging Indo-Pacific Humpback Dolphins (Sousa chinensis)
T2  - AQUATIC CONSERVATION-MARINE AND FRESHWATER ECOSYSTEMS
