TI  - Influence of socioeconomic costs on the conservation planning of Indo-Pacific humpback dolphin (Sousa chinensis) in a highly urbanised bay
T2  - GLOBAL ECOLOGY AND CONSERVATION
LA  - English
KW  - Conservation planning
KW  - Socioeconomic cost
KW  - Sousa chinensis
