TI  - Simplification of full spectrum soundscape analysis using specific frequencies
T2  - 2023 IEEE UNDERWATER TECHNOLOGY, UT
LA  - English
CP  - IEEE International Symposium on Underwater Technology (UT)
KW  - Soundscapes
KW  - Hong Kong International Airport
KW  - Bioacoustics
