TI  - Sighting of cetaceans off Kochi: A spatial and temporal analysis
T2  - INDIAN JOURNAL OF FISHERIES
LA  - English
KW  - Arabian sea
KW  - Distance from shore
KW  - India
KW  - Seasonality
KW  - Sightings
