KW  - SERUM PESTICIDE LEVELS
KW  - PEARL RIVER ESTUARY
KW  - POLYCHLORINATED-BIPHENYLS
KW  - ORGANOCHLORINE PESTICIDES
KW  - TISSUE DISTRIBUTION
KW  - TURSIOPS-TRUNCATUS
