TI  - The complete mitochondrial genome of the critically endangered Atlantic humpback dolphin, Sousa teuszii (Kukenthal, 1892)
T2  - MITOCHONDRIAL DNA PART B-RESOURCES
LA  - English
KW  - Atlantic humpback dolphin
