TI  - Cranial crassicaudiasis in two coastal dolphin species from South Africa is predominantly a disease of immature individuals
T2  - DISEASES OF AQUATIC ORGANISMS
LA  - English
KW  - Sousa plumbea
KW  - Tursiops aduncus
KW  - South Africa
