TI  - Efficiency and Effect Evaluation of Remote Biopsy Sampling on Indo-Pacific Humpback Dolphins (Sousa chinensis) in the Northern South China Sea
T2  - AQUATIC MAMMALS
LA  - English
KW  - Paxarms biopsy system
