TI  - THE EFFECTS OF HUMAN-DOLPHIN INTERACTION PROGRAMMES ON THE BEHAVIOUR OF THREE CAPTIVE INDO-PACIFIC HUMPBACK DOLPHINS (SOUSA CHINENSIS)
T2  - RAFFLES BULLETIN OF ZOOLOGY
